Here's a patch I made a few years ago that might be a solution for
Windows:

http://sourceforge.net/projects/nh-hyb-interf/

There's a pre-compiled executable. Press F12 to toggle fullscreen
mode. The window has a command menu, and the client area displays the
dungeon and old messages in 8x16 and 8x8 fonts, respectively. The
Win32 function that changes the desktop resolution is
ChangeDisplaySettingsEx(), which is Vista-compatible, but I've never
tested it on Vista.

